{
  "name": "progress",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "进度条 Progress",
  "description": "细腻、克制并支持确定与不确定状态的进度指示器。",
  "import": "import { Progress, progressVariants } from \"@/components/ui/progress\"",
  "exports": [
    "Progress",
    "progressVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "ProgressProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "npx wui@latest add @wui/progress",
    "shadcn": "npx shadcn@latest add http://localhost:3000/r/progress.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "radix-ui",
      "class-variance-authority"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "\"linear\" | \"circular\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "linear",
        "circular"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "linear",
      "description": "Layout of the progress indicator."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"sm\" | \"default\" | \"lg\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "sm",
        "default",
        "lg"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Thickness preset for linear progress and diameter preset for circular progress."
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "\"primary\" | \"blue\" | \"success\" | \"warning\" | \"destructive\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "primary",
        "blue",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "destructive"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "primary",
      "description": "Semantic accent used by the completed portion."
    },
    {
      "name": "showValue",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "defaultValue": "false",
      "description": "Shows the current percentage inside a circular indicator."
    },
    {
      "name": "indicatorClassName",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Extra classes applied to the completed portion."
    },
    {
      "name": "asChild",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Progress` 用于展示下载、上传、同步或处理任务的完成程度。它同时提供安静的线性轨道和紧凑环形布局；不传 `value` 时会显示不确定进度。",
  "extended": "### 颜色与环形进度\n\n使用 `color=\"primary | blue | success | warning | destructive\"` 表达不同语义。`variant=\"circular\"` 切换为环形布局，配合 `showValue` 在环内显示百分比；`size` 会分别调整线性轨道厚度或环形直径。动画会在系统开启“减少动态效果”时自动停用。",
  "events": "进度条是只读状态组件，不提供交互事件。使用 `value` 更新完成度，并通过 `aria-label` 或 `getValueLabel` 提供可访问描述。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "progress-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    },
    {
      "name": "progress-variants",
      "title": "颜色与环形进度"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/progress.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "http://localhost:3000/docs/components/progress",
  "sourceUrl": "http://localhost:3000/r/progress.json"
}
